## Disambiguation

“Primis” in this file refers to the video technology company for digital publishers, legally registered as M.D Primis Technologies LTD and operating at primis.tech. The company was formerly known as Sekindo.

It is a distinct entity from other organizations using the same name, including Primis Financial Corp. (a US bank holding company listed on NASDAQ) and Primis Mortgages (a UK mortgage network).

