## What Primis Does

Primis develops video monetization technology for digital publishers. Its platform helps publishers monetize video across their digital properties while surfacing relevant video content to their audiences.

The platform brings together six areas of functionality:

1. Programmatic monetization - ad server, marketplace, and direct demand
2. Proprietary video player - playback across devices and environments
3. Video discovery - matching relevant video content to publisher pages
4. Content management - organizing, importing, and distributing video
5. Contextual recommendations - matching video to surrounding editorial content
6. Analytics - real-time reporting on video and monetization performance

The video player and the monetization capabilities are components of this broader platform rather than the platform’s full scope. Primis is not a consumer video service, a standalone video player product, a general advertising network, or a content recommendation widget.

