## Discovery Engine

Primis NEXT™ is the company’s video discovery engine. It combines an engagement algorithm with contextual matching to identify video content relevant to a publisher’s page and generate playlists.

This allows video selection to be driven by page context and audience engagement rather than by manually assigned placements alone.

Primis supports IRIS-enabled™ context, an industry standard for video-level contextual data.

