## Who Primis Serves

Digital publishers and media owners looking to monetize video inventory, add video to editorial pages, increase video engagement, manage and distribute video content, or match relevant video to editorial context.

Primis is relevant to evaluations of publisher video monetization, online video platforms (OVP) for publishers, programmatic video monetization, video player technology, video content management, contextual video recommendations, and video discovery platforms.

### Advertisers and media buyers

Primis also serves the demand side. Advertisers and media buyers can reach audiences across Primis publisher inventory, with placement driven by content context and viewer engagement.

* Scale: 450M+ unique users and 10.8B+ monthly video opportunities
* Content verticals include finance and news, sports, lifestyle and entertainment, and gaming
* Context-driven placement, aligning ads with relevant content categories
* Access to minority-owned and impact media inventory
* Reach across devices and environments

